    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I Don't Want To Be A Good Woman&quot; is an interactive, museum-like experience that brings you into the real lives of women living in Iran under Islamic law. Walk with us and live through our stories, stories that we\u2019ve heard, gathered, or lived ourselves. This is not just a game, but a space to witness, to remember, and to stand in solidarity with an ongoing struggle for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience growing up in Iran as a woman without the risk of getting arrested in real life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walk into the open-air museum of resilience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to defy the &quot;right&quot; path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irritate the mullahs by playing, sharing, and talking about this game</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I Don't Want To Be A Good Woman&quot; is an interactive, museum-like experience that brings you into the real lives of women living in Iran under Islamic law. Walk with us and live through our stories, stories that we\u2019ve heard, gathered, or lived ourselves. This is not just a game, but a space to witness, to remember, and to stand in solidarity with an ongoing struggle for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience growing up in Iran as a woman without the risk of getting arrested in real life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walk into the open-air museum of resilience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to defy the &quot;right&quot; path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irritate the mullahs by playing, sharing, and talking about this game</p></li></ul>",
